      "rule_title": "May and Might for Possibility 🔮",
      "eng_exp": "When you are sure about things in the future, use will or won't. When you are not sure about things in the future, use may or might. Verbs don't change in the third person after may and might (I/You/He/She/It/We/They might use...). You can use time phrases like: One day, In the future, In five years, Soon. 100% 確定的「鐵漢預言家」：Will (一定會) / Won't (一定不會)。 50% 可能的「猶豫先生」：May / Might (可能會)。 還原超能力：動詞必須「打回原形」(Base form)。",
      "chi_exp": "主角 + will (100%確定) / may 或 might (50%可能) + 動詞原形。主角 + won't (100%一定不會) / may not 或 might not (50%可能不會) + 動詞原形",
