      "rule_title": "Quantifiers (數量詞) 🧙‍♂️",
      "eng_exp": "Some / Any: Use some and any with plural count nouns and noncount nouns. Use some in affirmative statements. Use any in negative statements and questions. Numbers: Use numbers with countable nouns. A lot of (lots of): Use with plural count nouns and noncount nouns. A few / A little: Use a few with plural count nouns. Use a little with noncount nouns. How much / How many: Use How many with plural count nouns. Use How much with noncount nouns.",
      "chi_exp": "Some / Any (一些) 這兩個詞可以用在複數可數名詞（如：apples）或不可數名詞（如：water）。Numbers (數字)數字（1, 2, 3...）只能搭配可數名詞。A lot of / Lots of (很多)這兩個詞是「萬用型」，可數與不可數名詞都可以用。A few / A little (一點點)這裡要特別注意搭配的對象：A few：搭配複數可數名詞。A little：搭配不可數名詞。How many / How much (多少？)這是用來詢問數量的疑問詞：How many：問複數可數名詞的數量。How much：問不可數名詞的分量（也常用來問價錢）。",
