      "rule_title": "Comparative Adjectives (比較級形容詞) ⚖️",
      "eng_exp": "We use comparative adjectives to compare two things. Short adjectives add -er (shorter). Words ending in -y change to -ier. We often use \"than\" after the adjective.",
