      "rule_title": "Comparative and Superlative Adjectives 🏆",
      "eng_exp": "We use comparative adjectives to compare two things (usually ending in -er, followed by \"than\"). We use superlative adjectives to compare three or more things, to show which one is the \"most\" (usually ending in -est, preceded by \"the\").",
      "chi_exp": "我們用「比較級 (-er + than)」來比較兩者；用「最高級 (the + -est)」來比較三個以上的事物，表示「最...」的狀態。字尾是 y 的要把 y 變成 i 再加 er/est。",
