        "Jazz isn't as old as blues. (爵士樂沒有藍調那麼古老。)",
        "Modern instruments aren't as easy to play as the earliest instruments. (現代樂器不像最早的樂器那麼容易演奏。)",
        "Pop music isn't as traditional as classical music. (流行音樂不如古典音樂傳統。)",
        "A CD player isn't as small as an MP3 player. (CD播放器沒有MP3播放器那麼小。)"
