      "rule_title": "Reduced Relative Clauses with \"Called\" (以 \"Called\" 縮減的形容詞子句) 🏷️",
      "eng_exp": "When defining or naming something, we can shorten \"which is/are called...\" into just \"called + Name\". This makes sentences cleaner and more natural.",
      "chi_exp": "在英文中，當我們要表達「被稱為...的某物」時，原本的文法是 \"which is called...\" 或 \"that are called...\"，但可以把關係代名詞和 be 動詞省略，直接簡化為 \"名詞 + called + 名稱\"。",
