      "eng_exp": "We use \"When + clause\" to indicate the specific time or condition at which another event takes place. Notice the order of events and tenses.",
      "chi_exp": "用 \"When (當...的時候)\" 來引導一個時間狀態。當 When 子句放在句首時，中間要加上逗號 (,)；如果放在主要子句後面，則不需要逗號。",
