      "rule_title": "Proper Nouns and Historical Tense Usage (專有名詞與歷史事件的過去時態) ⏳",
      "eng_exp": "Names of specific people (Galileo, Copernicus, Newton), historical years (1543, 1609, 1923), and unique objects are proper nouns and must be capitalized. When describing historical discoveries, we use the simple past tense (discovered, said, proved).",
      "chi_exp": "專有名詞（人名如 Copernicus, Galileo；年份如 1543, 1609）開頭第一個字母永遠要大寫！\\n2. 描述過去發生的歷史事件與科學發現時，動詞統統要使用「過去式 (Simple Past Tense)」，例如 discovered, proved, used。",
      "examples": [
        "In 1543, Nicolaus Copernicus wrote a famous book. (在 1543 年，尼古拉·哥白尼寫了一本著名的書。)",
        "In 1609, Galileo used a telescope. (在 1609 年，伽利略使用了一架望遠鏡。)",
        "Isaac Newton discovered gravity in England. (艾薩克·牛頓在英國發現了重力。)",
        "Edwin Hubble discovered another galaxy in 1923. (愛德溫·哈伯在 1923 年發現了另一個星系。)",
        "Thousands of years ago, people studied the sky. (數千年前，人們研究天空。)"
      ]
